cff-version: 1.2.0
title: MAMUT-routing-Poryos2026
type: dataset
message: >-
  Cite this metadata for the design and generation of Poryos2026, a benchmark with paired static and time-dependent routing instances. Attribute the underlying geographic data to OpenStreetMap and its contributors as specified in LICENSE. Record the exact Git commit used.
